<title>POLAND: POLISH AVERAGE WAGE SOARS TO PLN 1017 IN OCTOBER.</title>
<headline>POLISH AVERAGE WAGE SOARS TO PLN 1017 IN OCTOBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wage in the</p>
<p>enterprise sector rose to 1017 zlotys in October from 958</p>
<p>zlotys in September, and was 26.4 percent higher than a year</p>
<p>ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	OCTOBER    SEPTEMBER    OCT 1995</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN     1017	   958	   804</p>
